('sahih-al-bukhari',9,34,'34',NULL,NULL,NULL,'To offer (the ''Asr prayers) earlier on a cloudy day','باب التَّبْكِيرِ بِالصَّلاَةِ فِي يَوْمِ غَيْمٍ'),
