('sahih-al-bukhari',10,13,'13',NULL,NULL,NULL,'The Adhan before Al-Fajr (dawn)','باب الأَذَانِ قَبْلَ الْفَجْرِ'),
('sahih-al-bukhari',10,14,'14',NULL,NULL,NULL,'How long should the interval between the Adhan and the Iqama be? (And something concerning) the person who wants for the Iqama','باب كَمْ بَيْنَ الأَذَانِ وَالإِقَامَةِ وَمَنْ يَنْتَظِرُ الإِقَامَةَ'),
('sahih-al-bukhari',10,15,'15',NULL,NULL,NULL,'Whoever waits for the Iqama of the prayer','باب مَنِ انْتَظَرَ الإِقَامَةَ'),
