('sahih-al-bukhari',10,23,'23',NULL,NULL,NULL,'One should not stand for As-Salat (the prayer) hurriedly but with calmness and solemnity.','باب لاَ يَسْعَى إِلَى الصَّلاَةِ مُسْتَعْجِلاً، وَلْيَقُمْ بِالسَّكِينَةِ وَالْوَقَارِ'),
('sahih-al-bukhari',10,24,'24',NULL,NULL,NULL,'Can one go out of the mosque (after the Adhan, or the Iqama) if there is a genuine excuse?','باب هَلْ يَخْرُجُ مِنَ الْمَسْجِدِ لِعِلَّةٍ'),
