('sahih-al-bukhari',23,52,'52',NULL,NULL,NULL,'The saying of the deceased while he is being carried on the bier, "Take me quickly."','باب قَوْلِ الْمَيِّتِ وَهُوَ عَلَى الْجِنَازَةِ قَدِّمُونِي'),
