('sahih-al-bukhari',24,23,'22',NULL,NULL,NULL,'To give in charity as much as you can afford','باب الصَّدَقَةِ فِيمَا اسْتَطَاعَ'),
('sahih-al-bukhari',24,24,'23',NULL,NULL,NULL,'As-Sadaqa (charity) expiates sins','باب الصَّدَقَةُ تُكَفِّرُ الْخَطِيئَةَ'),
('sahih-al-bukhari',24,25,'24',NULL,NULL,NULL,'Whoever gave things in charity while he was a Mushrik and then embraced Islam','باب مَنْ تَصَدَّقَ فِي الشِّرْكِ ثُمَّ أَسْلَمَ'),
('sahih-al-bukhari',24,26,'25',NULL,NULL,NULL,'The servant gets a reward for giving charity when ordered by the owner','باب أَجْرِ الْخَادِمِ إِذَا تَصَدَّقَ بِأَمْرِ صَاحِبِهِ غَيْرَ مُفْسِدٍ'),
('sahih-al-bukhari',24,27,'26',NULL,NULL,NULL,'The reward of the lady who gives in charity, from her husbandâ€™s house','باب أَجْرِ الْمَرْأَةِ إِذَا تَصَدَّقَتْ أَوْ أَطْعَمَتْ مِنْ بَيْتِ زَوْجِهَا غَيْرَ مُفْسِدَةٍ'),
('sahih-al-bukhari',24,28,'27',NULL,NULL,NULL,'The Statement of Allah Ta''ala: "As for the one who is charitable, mindful of Allah, and firmly believes in the finest reward, We will facilitate for them the Way of Ease. And as for the one who is stingy, indifferent to Allah, and staunchly denies the finest reward, We will facilitate for them the path of hardship.'' (92:5-10)','بَابُ قَوْلِ اللَّهِ تَعَالَى: {فَأَمَّا مَنْ أَعْطَى وَاتَّقَى وَصَدَّقَ بِالْحُسْنَى فَسَنُيَسِّرُهُ لِلْيُسْرَى وَأَمَّا مَنْ بَخِلَ وَاسْتَغْنَى وَكَذَّبَ بِالْحُسْنَى فَسَنُيَسِّرُهُ لِلْعُسْرَى}'),
('sahih-al-bukhari',24,29,'28',NULL,NULL,NULL,'The examples of an alms-giver and a miser','باب مَثَلِ الْمُتَصَدِّقِ وَالْبَخِيلِ'),
('sahih-al-bukhari',24,30,'29',NULL,NULL,NULL,'Giving in charity from the earnings and trade','بَابُ صَدَقَةِ الْكَسْبِ وَالتِّجَارَةِ'),
('sahih-al-bukhari',24,31,'30',NULL,NULL,NULL,'Every Muslim has to give in charity','باب عَلَى كُلِّ مُسْلِمٍ صَدَقَةٌ، فَمَنْ لَمْ يَجِدْ فَلْيَعْمَلْ بِالْمَعْرُوفِ'),
('sahih-al-bukhari',24,32,'31',NULL,NULL,NULL,'How much is Zakat, and how much may be given in charity? And whoever gave a sheep in charity.','باب قَدْرُ كَمْ يُعْطَى مِنَ الزَّكَاةِ وَالصَّدَقَةِ وَمَنْ أَعْطَى شَاةً'),
('sahih-al-bukhari',24,33,'32',NULL,NULL,NULL,'The Zakat of silver','باب زَكَاةِ الْوَرِقِ'),
('sahih-al-bukhari',24,34,'33',NULL,NULL,NULL,'Zakat may be paid in kind','باب الْعَرْضِ فِي الزَّكَاةِ'),
('sahih-al-bukhari',24,35,'34',NULL,NULL,NULL,'The individual property of different people should neither be gathered together nor the joint property should be divided, in assessing the Zakat','باب لاَ يُجْمَعُ بَيْنَ مُتَفَرِّقٍ وَلاَ يُفَرَّقُ بَيْنَ مُجْتَمِعٍ'),
('sahih-al-bukhari',24,36,'35',NULL,NULL,NULL,'If a property is equally owned by two partners, its Zakat is to be paid as a whole','باب مَا كَانَ مِنْ خَلِيطَيْنِ فَإِنَّهُمَا يَتَرَاجَعَانِ بَيْنَهُمَا بِالسَّوِيَّةِ'),
('sahih-al-bukhari',24,37,'36',NULL,NULL,NULL,'The Zakat of camels','باب زَكَاةِ الإِبِلِ'),
('sahih-al-bukhari',24,38,'37',NULL,NULL,NULL,'Whoever has to pay a one-year-old she-camel as Zakat and has not got it','باب مَنْ بَلَغَتْ عِنْدَهُ صَدَقَةُ بِنْتِ مَخَاضٍ وَلَيْسَتْ عِنْدَهُ'),
('sahih-al-bukhari',24,39,'38',NULL,NULL,NULL,'The Zakat of sheep','باب زَكَاةِ الْغَنَمِ'),
('sahih-al-bukhari',24,40,'39',NULL,NULL,NULL,'Neither an old, nor a defective animal, nor a male-goat may be taken as Zakat','باب لاَ تُؤْخَذُ فِي الصَّدَقَةِ هَرِمَةٌ وَلاَ ذَاتُ عَوَارٍ وَلاَ تَيْسٌ إِلاَّ مَا شَاءَ الْمُصَدِّقُ'),
('sahih-al-bukhari',24,41,'40',NULL,NULL,NULL,'To accept a young (female) goat as Zakat','باب أَخْذِ الْعَنَاقِ فِي الصَّدَقَةِ'),
('sahih-al-bukhari',24,42,'41',NULL,NULL,NULL,'"Do not take the best from the property as Zakat"','باب لاَ تُؤْخَذُ كَرَائِمُ أَمْوَالِ النَّاسِ فِي الصَّدَقَةِ'),
('sahih-al-bukhari',24,43,'42',NULL,NULL,NULL,'There is no Zakat for less than five camels','باب لَيْسَ فِيمَا دُونَ خَمْسِ ذَوْدٍ صَدَقَةٌ'),
('sahih-al-bukhari',24,44,'43',NULL,NULL,NULL,'The Zakat of cows','باب زَكَاةِ الْبَقَرِ'),
('sahih-al-bukhari',24,45,'44',NULL,NULL,NULL,'The giving of Zakat to relatives','باب الزَّكَاةِ عَلَى الأَقَارِبِ'),
('sahih-al-bukhari',24,46,'45',NULL,NULL,NULL,'No Zakat on the horse of a Muslim','باب لَيْسَ عَلَى الْمُسْلِمِ فِي فَرَسِهِ صَدَقَةٌ'),
('sahih-al-bukhari',24,47,'46',NULL,NULL,NULL,'No Zakat on the slave belonging to a Muslim','باب لَيْسَ عَلَى الْمُسْلِمِ فِي عَبْدِهِ صَدَقَةٌ'),
('sahih-al-bukhari',24,48,'47',NULL,NULL,NULL,'Giving in charity to orphans','باب الصَّدَقَةِ عَلَى الْيَتَامَى'),
('sahih-al-bukhari',24,49,'48',NULL,NULL,NULL,'The giving of Zakat to husband and to orphans','باب الزَّكَاةِ عَلَى الزَّوْجِ وَالأَيْتَامِ فِي الْحَجْرِ'),
('sahih-al-bukhari',24,50,'49',NULL,NULL,NULL,'The Statement of Allah Ta''ala: "(Alms-tax should be spent)... to free the slaves; and for those in debt; and for Allah''s cause..." (9:60)','بَابُ قَوْلِ اللَّهِ تَعَالَى: {وَفِي الرِّقَابِ}، {وَفِي سَبِيلِ اللَّهِ}'),
('sahih-al-bukhari',24,51,'50',NULL,NULL,NULL,'To abstain from begging','باب الاِسْتِعْفَافِ عَنِ الْمَسْأَلَةِ'),
('sahih-al-bukhari',24,52,'51',NULL,NULL,NULL,'The one whom Allah gives something without his asking for it, or without avarice for it','باب مَنْ أَعْطَاهُ اللَّهُ شَيْئًا مِنْ غَيْرِ مَسْأَلَةٍ وَلاَ إِشْرَافِ نَفْسٍ'),
('sahih-al-bukhari',24,53,'52',NULL,NULL,NULL,'Whoever asks the people to increase his wealth','باب مَنْ سَأَلَ النَّاسَ تَكَثُّرًا'),
('sahih-al-bukhari',24,54,'53',NULL,NULL,NULL,'The Statement of Allah ''Azza wa Jall: "... They do not beg people persistently. ..." (2:273) And who may be considered to have enough to be content and abstain from begging"','بَابُ قَوْلِ اللَّهِ تَعَالَى: {لاَ يَسْأَلُونَ النَّاسَ إِلْحَافًا} وَكَمِ الْغِنَى'),
('sahih-al-bukhari',24,55,'54',NULL,NULL,NULL,'Estimating the date-fruits on the palms for Zakat','باب خَرْصِ التَّمْرِ'),
('sahih-al-bukhari',24,56,'55',NULL,NULL,NULL,'One-twentieth on the yield of the land irrigated by rain or running water','باب الْعُشْرِ فِيمَا يُسْقَى مِنْ مَاءِ السَّمَاءِ وَبِالْمَاءِ الْجَارِي'),
('sahih-al-bukhari',24,57,'56',NULL,NULL,NULL,'There is no Zakat on less than five Awsuq','باب لَيْسَ فِيمَا دُونَ خَمْسَةِ أَوْسُقٍ صَدَقَةٌ'),
('sahih-al-bukhari',24,58,'57',NULL,NULL,NULL,'Zakat of dates should be taken during their plucking season. Can a child touch the dates collected as Zakat?','باب أَخْذِ صَدَقَةِ التَّمْرِ عِنْدَ صِرَامِ النَّخْلِ وَهَلْ يُتْرَكُ الصَّبِيُّ فَيَمَسُّ تَمْرَ الصَّدَقَةِ'),
