('sahih-al-bukhari',24,60,'59',NULL,NULL,NULL,'Can one buy the thing which he has given in charity?','باب هَلْ يَشْتَرِي صَدَقَتَهُ'),
('sahih-al-bukhari',24,61,'60',NULL,NULL,NULL,'What is said regarding what is given to the Prophet (saws)  and his offspring in charity','باب مَا يُذْكَرُ فِي الصَّدَقَةِ لِلنَّبِيِّ صلى الله عليه وسلم'),
('sahih-al-bukhari',24,62,'61',NULL,NULL,NULL,'As-Sadaqa for the freed slave-girls of the wives of the Prophet ﷺ','باب الصَّدَقَةِ عَلَى مَوَالِي أَزْوَاجِ النَّبِيِّ صلى الله عليه وسلم'),
('sahih-al-bukhari',24,63,'62',NULL,NULL,NULL,'When alms is transferred','باب إِذَا تَحَوَّلَتِ الصَّدَقَةُ'),
