('sahih-al-bukhari',24,65,'64',NULL,NULL,NULL,'The invoking and supplicating of the Imam for the one who gives in charity','باب صَلاَةِ الإِمَامِ وَدُعَائِهِ لِصَاحِبِ الصَّدَقَةِ'),
('sahih-al-bukhari',24,66,'65',NULL,NULL,NULL,'(Is Zakat imposed on) what is taken out of the sea','باب مَا يُسْتَخْرَجُ مِنَ الْبَحْرِ'),
