('sahih-al-bukhari',24,68,'67',NULL,NULL,NULL,'The Statement of Allah Most High: "... And those employed to collect (the funds) ..." (9:60) And the Imam is to supervise and check the work of the collectors.','بَابُ قَوْلِ اللَّهِ تَعَالَى: {وَالْعَامِلِينَ عَلَيْهَا} وَمُحَاسَبَةِ الْمُصَدِّقِينَ مَعَ الإِمَامِ'),
('sahih-al-bukhari',24,69,'68',NULL,NULL,NULL,'The use of the camels and their milk given as Zakat','باب اسْتِعْمَالِ إِبِلِ الصَّدَقَةِ وَأَلْبَانِهَا لأَبْنَاءِ السَّبِيلِ'),
('sahih-al-bukhari',24,70,'69',NULL,NULL,NULL,'Branding the camels given in As-Sadaqa (Zakat) by the Imam with his own hands','باب وَسْمِ الإِمَامِ إِبِلَ الصَّدَقَةِ بِيَدِهِ'),
