('sahih-al-bukhari',24,79,'78',NULL,NULL,NULL,'Sadaqat-ul-Fitr is obligatory on the young and the old','باب صَدَقَةِ الْفِطْرِ عَلَى الصَّغِيرِ وَالْكَبِيرِ'),
