('sahih-al-bukhari',30,61,'61',NULL,NULL,NULL,'Whoever visited some people and did not break his (optional) Saum (fast) with them','باب مَنْ زَارَ قَوْمًا فَلَمْ يُفْطِرْ عِنْدَهُمْ'),
