('sahih-al-bukhari',32,4,'4',NULL,NULL,NULL,'The knowledge of the night of Qadr was taken away because of the quarrelling','باب رَفْعِ مَعْرِفَةِ لَيْلَةِ الْقَدْرِ لِتَلاَحِي النَّاسِ'),
