('sahih-al-bukhari',33,9,'9',NULL,NULL,NULL,'Coming out of I''tikaf in the morning of the twentieth (of Ramadan)','باب الاِعْتِكَافِ وَخَرَجَ النَّبِيُّ صلى الله عليه وسلم صَبِيحَةَ عِشْرِينَ'),
('sahih-al-bukhari',33,10,'10',NULL,NULL,NULL,'I''tikaf of a woman who has bleeding in between her periods','باب اعْتِكَافِ الْمُسْتَحَاضَةِ'),
