('sahih-al-bukhari',78,116,'116',NULL,NULL,NULL,'Al-Ma''arid is a safe way to avoid a lie','باب الْمَعَارِيضُ مَنْدُوحَةٌ عَنِ الْكَذِبِ'),
('sahih-al-bukhari',78,117,'117',NULL,NULL,NULL,'The description of something by a man as ''nothing'' while he means that it is not true','باب قَوْلِ الرَّجُلِ لِلشَّىْءِ لَيْسَ بِشَىْءٍ وَهْوَ يَنْوِي أَنَّهُ لَيْسَ بِحَقٍّ‏‏'),
