('sahih-muslim',2,10,'10',NULL,NULL,NULL,'The obligation of completely washing all the parts to be washed when purifying oneself','باب وُجُوبِ اسْتِيعَابِ جَمِيعِ أَجْزَاءِ مَحَلِّ الطَّهَارَةِ ‏‏'),
('sahih-muslim',2,11,'11',NULL,NULL,NULL,'Sins exit with the water of wudu’','باب خُرُوجِ الْخَطَايَا مَعَ مَاءِ الْوُضُوءِ ‏‏'),
