('sahih-muslim',2,13,'13',NULL,NULL,NULL,'Adornment (in the hereafter) will reach as far as the wudu’ reached','باب تَبْلُغُ الْحِلْيَةُ حَيْث يَبْلُغُ الْوَضُوءُ ‏‏'),
