('sahih-muslim',4,40,'40',NULL,NULL,NULL,'What Is To Be Said When Raising One''s Head From Bowing','باب مَا يَقُولُ إِذَا رَفَعَ رَأْسَهُ مِنَ الرُّكُوعِ ‏'),
