('sahih-muslim',5,4,'4',NULL,NULL,NULL,'The virtue of building masajid and encouragement to do so','باب فَضْلِ بِنَاءِ الْمَسَاجِدِ وَالْحَثِّ عَلَيْهَا ‏'),
