('sahih-muslim',5,13,'13',NULL,NULL,NULL,'The prohibition of spitting in the masjid, during prayer and at other times. The prohibition of a praying person spitting in front of him or to his right','باب النَّهْىِ عَنِ الْبُصَاقِ، فِي الْمَسْجِدِ فِي الصَّلاَةِ وَغَيْرِهَا ‏‏'),
('sahih-muslim',5,14,'14',NULL,NULL,NULL,'The permissibility of offering salat while wearing shoes','باب جَوَازِ الصَّلاَةِ فِي النَّعْلَيْنِ ‏'),
('sahih-muslim',5,15,'15',NULL,NULL,NULL,'It is disliked to offer salat in a garment with markings','باب كَرَاهَةِ الصَّلاَةِ فِي ثَوْبٍ لَهُ أَعْلاَمٌ‏'),
