('sahih-muslim',5,17,'17',NULL,NULL,NULL,'Prohibiting one who has eaten garlic, onions, or leeks, and other things that have an offensive odor from coming to the masjid, until that smell has gone away, and such a person should be expelled from the masjid','باب نَهْىِ مَنْ أَكَلَ ثُومًا أَوْ بَصَلاً أَوْ كُرَّاثًا أَوْ نَحْوَهَا عَنْ حُضُورِ الْمَسْجِدِ ‏‏'),
('sahih-muslim',5,18,'18',NULL,NULL,NULL,'The prohibition of making lost property announcements in the masjid, and what should be said by one who hears a person making such an announcement','باب النَّهْىِ عَنْ نَشْدِ الضَّالَّةِ، فِي الْمَسْجدِ وَمَا يَقُولُهُ مَنْ سَمِعَ النَّاشِدَ ‏'),
('sahih-muslim',5,19,'19',NULL,NULL,NULL,'As-Sahw (forgetfulness) in prayer and prostrating to compensate for it','باب السَّهْوِ فِي الصَّلاَةِ وَالسُّجُودِ لَهُ ‏'),
('sahih-muslim',5,20,'20',NULL,NULL,NULL,'The prostration of recitation','باب سُجُودِ التِّلاَوَةِ ‏'),
('sahih-muslim',5,21,'21',NULL,NULL,NULL,'The description of the sitting during the prayer, and how the hands are to be placed on the thighs','باب صِفَةِ الْجُلُوسِ فِي الصَّلاَةِ وَكَيْفِيَّةِ وَضْعِ الْيَدَيْنِ عَلَى الْفَخِذَيْنِ ‏'),
('sahih-muslim',5,22,'22',NULL,NULL,NULL,'The salam to exit the prayer when one has finished and how it is done','باب السَّلاَمِ لِلتَّحْلِيلِ مِنَ الصَّلاَةِ عِنْدَ فَرَاغِهَا وَكَيْفِيَّتِهِ ‏‏'),
('sahih-muslim',5,23,'23',NULL,NULL,NULL,'The remembrance after the prayer','باب الذِّكْرِ بَعْدَ الصَّلاَةِ ‏'),
('sahih-muslim',5,24,'24',NULL,NULL,NULL,'It is recommended to seek refuge with Allah from the punishment of the grave, the punishment of hell, the trials of life and death, the tribulation of the Dajjal and from sin and debt between the tashah-hud and the taslim','باب اسْتِحْبَابِ التَّعَوُّذِ مِنْ عَذَابِ الْقَبْرِ ‏'),
