('sahih-muslim',5,27,'27',NULL,NULL,NULL,'What is to be said between the opening takbir and the recitation of the Qur’an','باب مَا يُقَالُ بَيْنَ تَكْبِيرَةِ الإِحْرَامِ وَالْقِرَاءَةِ'),
